{"title":"Spider Friend Ledger","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Hobb Rusk</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"wp-quest\"><b>Quest item.</b> Asked for by The Trappers&#39; Camp.</p>\n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"hobb-rusk\" title=\"Hobb Rusk - Normal, 25.0% of recorded drops (1 / 4 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/9838b40105cbcdb93973.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hobb Rusk</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25.0%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"spider-friend-ledger\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/607a1ce9102160ce01f0.svg\" alt=\"Spider Friend Ledger\"></div><h3>Spider Friend Ledger</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>1 monster</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/15/2026, 9:37:41 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}